      "exp_en": "Under HIPAA, patients may amend protected health information. Those corrections are referred to in the law as \"amendments\". The records themselves are called a \"designated record set\". The health care provider must act on the request within 60 days, but may extend up to another 30 days if a reason is provided in writing. Health care providers are not required to make the requested change. In many cases, the changes will benefit both the patient and the provider. If the provider refuses to make an amendment they must notify the patient of their decision in writing. A patient may submit a formal, written disagreement which must be added to the file. www.hhs.gov/hipaa/",
      "exp_hant": "依據HIPAA規定，病患可要求修改其受保護的健康資訊，此類更正在法規中稱為「修訂」，病歷本身則稱為「指定紀錄集」。醫療提供者必須於收到請求後60天內處理，若能以書面說明理由，最多可再延長30天。醫療提供者並無義務一定要進行所要求的變更。多數情況下，變更對病患與提供者雙方皆有益。若提供者拒絕進行修訂，須以書面通知病患其決定。病患可提出正式的書面異議，該異議須併入病歷檔案中。www.hhs.gov/hipaa/"
