      "number": 29,
      "question_en": "Leukemia is",
      "question_hant": "白血病是：",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Cancer of the red blood cells",
          "hant": "紅血球的癌症",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "Cancer of the nervous tissue",
          "hant": "神經組織的癌症",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "Cancer of white blood cells",
          "hant": "白血球的癌症",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "Cancer in the lymphatic system",
          "hant": "淋巴系統的癌症",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "In leukemia, the bone marrow produces abnormal white blood cells, called leukemia cells. These cells grow faster than normal white cells and do not stop growing like normal cells do. Eventually, the leukemia cells crowd out normal blood cells, causing anemia, bleeding, and infections. An overgrowth of leukemia cells can spread to the lymph nodes or other organs and cause swelling and pain. There are various types of leukemias. Acute leukemia worsens quickly and produces symptoms quickly. Chronic leukemia has a slow progression and will not show symptoms for years. Lymphocytic leukemia affects the WBCs called lymphocytes. Myelogenous leukemia affects the cells that would normally become granulocytes, red blood cells, or platelets. Symptoms of leukemia include swollen lymph nodes, enlarged liver or spleen, unexplained weight loss, frequent infections, fever-chills, frequent nosebleeds, excess night sweats, bone pain-tenderness. tcmtests.com, April 2020",
      "exp_hant": "白血病是骨髓製造出異常的白血球，稱為白血病細胞。這些細胞的增生速度比正常白血球快，且不會像正常細胞一樣停止生長。最終，白血病細胞會排擠正常血球，導致貧血、出血及感染。白血病細胞增生過度時，可能擴散至淋巴結或其他器官，造成腫脹與疼痛。白血病有多種類型：急性白血病惡化及症狀出現皆快速；慢性白血病進展緩慢，可能多年不出現症狀；淋巴性白血病影響稱為淋巴球的白血球；骨髓性白血病則影響原本應分化為顆粒球、紅血球或血小板的細胞。白血病的症狀包括淋巴結腫大、肝脾腫大、不明原因體重減輕、反覆感染、發燒寒顫、頻繁流鼻血、盜汗過多、骨骼疼痛壓痛。tcmtests.com, April 2020"
    },
    {
      "number": 30,
      "question_en": "Which of the following is an accurate comparison between measles and chickenpox?",
      "question_hant": "下列關於麻疹與水痘的比較，何者正確？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Both chickenpox and measles have red spots that are fluid filled",
          "hant": "水痘與麻疹的紅疹皆會有液體填充",
