      "exp_en": "The 8-Principles diagnosis Is Interior, Hot, Deficiency. The organ pattern diagnosis is Lung and Kidney yin deficiency. The treatment principle is to nourish and tonify Lung and Kidney yin. For the original treatment, BL-13 tonifies Lung qi and nourishes Lung yin. BL-17 is between the upper and middle burners and is used to regulate the qi of both and helps to support BL-13. BL-20 strengthens the Spleen to support the function of the Lung and Kidney. BL-23 tonifies the Kidney. As the cough improved but symptoms of yin deficiency (night sweats, afternoon fever) were still prevalent, the additional point combination of LU-7 and KI-6 were added. These two points regulate Lung qi and nourish Lung and Kidney yin. As the opening and couple points of the Directing Vessel, these two points nourish yin, promote the down flow of Lung qi and the Kidney receiving qi. They help to treat the symptoms of yin xu as well as regulating the Lung and Kidney in their relation to qi. Though REN-4 strengthens the yin, REN-6 was not needed as her energy level was improving. LI-4 and KI-7 treat the sweating but not the afternoon fever. Her BP is slightly elevated. Her Hematocrit and Hemoglobin readings show slight anemia present. In adults, normal specific urine gravity values range from 1.003 to 1.030. Normal potassium levels are 3.5 to 5.2 mEq/L but normal value ranges may vary slightly among different labs. Normal BUN (blood urea nitrogen) levels are generally 6-20 mg/d. Her result shows that the kidneys are not working efficiently. The normal range for blood sodium (Na) levels is 135 to 145 milliequivalents per liter (mEq/L). Acupuncture Patterns and Practice, Eastland Press, 1993, Xuemai and Jingyi, Pages 29-35",
      "exp_hant": "八綱辨證為裡、熱、虛。臟腑辨證為肺腎陰虛。治療原則為滋補肺腎之陰。原始治療中，肺俞補肺氣並滋養肺陰。膈俞位居上、中二焦之間，用以調理二焦之氣，並輔助肺俞之效。脾俞健脾以支持肺腎功能。腎俞補腎。由於咳嗽已有改善，但陰虛症狀（盜汗、午後發熱）仍持續存在，因此加入列缺與照海此一穴位組合。這兩穴能調理肺氣並滋養肺腎之陰。作為任脈的開穴及其配穴，這兩穴能滋陰、促進肺氣下降及腎之納氣。它們有助於治療陰虛症狀，同時調理肺腎在氣機方面的關係。雖然關元能加強滋陰之效，但由於病人體力已在改善中，故不需加用氣海。合谷與復溜可治療盜汗，卻無法治療午後發熱。她的血壓略為偏高。血比容與血色素數值顯示存在輕度貧血。成人尿液比重正常值範圍為1.003至1.030。血鉀正常值為3.5至5.2 mEq/L，但不同檢驗室之正常範圍可能略有差異。血中尿素氮（BUN）正常值一般為6-20 mg/dL。她的檢驗結果顯示腎功能運作不佳。血鈉（Na）正常範圍為135至145 mEq/L。Acupuncture Patterns and Practice, Eastland Press, 1993, Xuemai and Jingyi, Pages 29-35"
