      ],
      "exp_en": "This is the most complete and accurate answer. When making a correction to the medical record, never write over or obliterate the passage when an entry to a medical record is made in error. Draw a single line through the incorrect information, keeping the original entry legible. Sign or initial and date the deletion. State the reason for the correction above or in the margin. Document the correct information on the next line/space with the current date and time. Correction of electronic records also keep track of both the original entry and the correction with the current date, time, reason for the change and initials of person making the correction. When a hard copy is generated from an electronic record, both records must show the correction. Deliberate falsification of medical records is a felony offense. Acupuncture Risk Management, CMS Press, Kailin, 1997 page 80",
      "exp_hant": "此為最完整且準確的答案。當病歷記錄發生錯誤需要更正時，切勿塗改或塗黑原本的內容。應在錯誤資訊上劃一條線，保持原始內容清晰可辨。並在刪除處簽名或簽署縮寫並註明日期，於上方或空白處說明更正原因，再於下一行／空格以目前的日期與時間記錄正確資訊。電子病歷的更正同樣須保留原始記錄與更正內容，並記錄目前日期、時間、更正原因及更正者的簽名縮寫。若由電子記錄印出紙本，該紙本亦須同時顯示更正內容。蓄意竄改病歷屬於重罪。Acupuncture Risk Management, CMS Press, Kailin, 1997 page 80"
