    {
      "number": 147,
      "question_en": "For the past two years a 52 year-old female has had episodic, unilateral headaches. She could not identify any causative factor. Three days ago she had a right-side headache after attending a family funeral. The headache is fixed and worsens when she is upset or sad. The headaches are interrupting her sleep. She has a dry throat with thirst and a desire to drink. Her appetite is normal but she has epigastric distention when she eats sweets. She complains of feeling hot and easily sweating. She reports light and occasional chest pain, mainly on the left side. She has right upper arm pain but without limitation in movement. The tongue is dark red with slightly thick-greasy-dry coating. The pulse is deep and wiry. Blood Pressure is 120/70, Pulse 72, Respirations 18, Temperature 98.6 F. Medications include Thiazide 25 mg, 1 tablet daily for hypertension. CT of the skull is negative. MRI of the brain is negative. Acupuncture prescription: on the right side the points tai yang and GB-20 (feng chi) were needled and on the left side the points ST-36 (zu san li), and SP-6 (san yin jiao) were needled. LI-4 (he gu) and KI-7 (fu liu) were needled on both sides. After several treatments she reports that the sweating was normal and that she no longer experienced epigastric distention. She reported just slight improvement with the headache and still feeling hot. What would you add to the prescription?",
      "question_hant": "一名52歲女性過去兩年來反覆出現單側頭痛，未能找出誘發因素。三天前，她在參加家族喪禮後出現右側頭痛。頭痛部位固定，情緒低落或悲傷時加重，並影響睡眠。她咽喉乾燥、口渴欲飲。食慾正常，但吃甜食後會出現胃脘脹滿。她自覺發熱且容易出汗，偶爾出現輕微的胸痛，主要在左側。右上臂疼痛，但活動不受限。舌暗紅，苔略厚膩而乾，脈沉弦。血壓120/70，脈搏72，呼吸18，體溫98.6°F。目前服用治療高血壓的Thiazide 25mg，每日一錠。頭顱電腦斷層與腦部核磁共振皆為陰性。針灸處方：右側取太陽穴與風池（GB-20），左側取足三里（ST-36）與三陰交（SP-6），雙側取合谷（LI-4）與復溜（KI-7）。經數次治療後，她表示出汗已恢復正常，也不再有胃脘脹滿。頭痛僅略有改善，仍感覺發熱。此時您會在處方中加入什麼？",
