      "exp_en": "The diagnosis is Kidney Yin Deficiency with Empty Heat. Were the pattern not to include symptoms of Empty Heat (thirst for small sips, feeling hot in the evening, anxious at night) then it would be a pure Deficient Kidney Yin pattern which would have a normal tongue and be without coating. Since the pattern includes Empty Heat then the tongue color becomes red to reflect the Heat. If the Empty Heat advances even further and becomes more severe you get the pattern of Kidney Yin Deficiency with Empty Heat Blazing in which the tongue is red without coating, cracked, and with redder tip. The tongue coating is a function of the Spleen (transformation and transportation of food) and mainly the Stomach (food ripening). Earth is associated with turbid Dampness. A normal tongue will have a thin coating which is mostly a manifestation of Stomach Qi. As the tongue coating is connected to the Stomach, a yin deficiency condition is always associated with Stomach yin deficiency. The weak Stomach yin fails to produce the coating. In other words, in yin deficiency the Stomach is always involved. The pulse in this pattern is floating and empty. Back pain and night sweats are sufficient to make the diagnosis of Kidney Yin Deficiency and adding feeling hot in the evening is sufficient to make the diagnosis of Kidney Yin Deficiency with Empty Heat. The treatment principle is Nourish Kidney Yin and, if needed, Clear Empty Heat. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 627; 2005 Edition, page 593; 1989 Edition, page 252",
      "exp_hant": "診斷為腎陰虛夾虛熱。若病案中不含虛熱症狀（口渴喜小口飲、傍晚發熱、夜間焦慮），則屬單純腎陰虛，舌色應正常且無苔。由於病案包含虛熱症狀，故舌色轉紅以反映熱象。若虛熱進一步加重，則會出現腎陰虛虛火熾盛之證，此時舌紅無苔、有裂紋，且舌尖更紅。舌苔的生成與脾（運化水穀）及主要是胃（腐熟水穀）的功能有關。「土」與濕濁相應。正常舌象應有薄苔，主要反映胃氣。由於舌苔與胃相關，陰虛之證必然伴隨胃陰虛，胃陰不足則無法生成舌苔。換言之，陰虛時胃必然受累。此證脈象為浮而虛。腰痛與盜汗即足以診斷腎陰虛，再加上傍晚發熱則足以診斷腎陰虛夾虛熱。治療原則為滋補腎陰，必要時清虛熱。The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 627; 2005 Edition, page 593; 1989 Edition, page 252"
