      "exp_en": "The KNOTTED PULSE is a rhythm pulse. It is a pulse that is slow and stops at irregular intervals. The knotted pulse indicates inner Cold with stuck qi and Blood. It always is associated with a Heart disorder. The LEATHER PULSE is an empty type of pulse. This pulse is felt superficially and feels like a stretched skin of a drum but at the deep level it is empty. On the outside the pulse feels hard but empty on the inside. The leather pulse indicates severe deficiency of Blood, Essence, or yin. The OVERFLOWING PULSE is a full type pulse. This pulse feels large, very superficial, and broad. It feels like a river overflowing its banks. The overflowing pulse indicates Heat and is almost always rapid. An overflowing pulse with strength indicates a full-hot condition. an overflowing pulse with no strength (feels large but disappears with pressure) indicates yin xu with empty fire. The SCATTERED PULSE is an empty type pulse. Rather than the pulse flowing, the scattered pulse feels like it is broken into tiny dots. The pulse is relatively superficial and disappears with stronger palpation. The scattered pulse indicates severe qi and Blood xu, especially xu of Kidney qi and Original Qi. This pulse indicates a serious disorder. If this pulse manifests in pregnancy, it can indicate a miscarriage can occur. Diagnosis in Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2004, page 496",
      "exp_hant": "結脈屬於節律類脈象，是一種脈來遲緩且不規則歇止的脈象。結脈顯示體內有寒邪伴氣血瘀阻，且常與心的病變相關。革脈屬虛類脈象，此脈輕取時感覺表淺，猶如繃緊的鼓皮，但重按則空虛無物，外硬內空。革脈顯示血、精或陰的嚴重虧虛。洪脈屬實類脈象，此脈形大、極為表淺且寬闊，猶如江河氾濫。洪脈顯示熱邪，且幾乎必兼數象。洪脈有力則顯示實熱之證；洪脈無力（脈形寬大但按之即消失）則顯示陰虛夾虛火。散脈屬虛類脈象。散脈並非以脈波起伏的方式呈現，而是彷彿斷裂成細小的點。此脈相對表淺，用力按壓即消失。散脈顯示氣血嚴重虧虛，尤其是腎氣與元氣的虧虛，此脈象一向提示病情嚴重。若孕婦出現此脈，可能顯示將發生流產。Diagnosis in Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2004, page 496"
