      "exp_en": "The diagnosis is Large Intestine Heat. This pattern is often generated by eating too many hot foods (lamb, beef, alcohol). This is an Excess and Hot condition. The Dryness arises from the Heat burning Body Fluids. The expected pulse in this pattern is a Full-Rapid pulse. A Full pulse can either mean a pulse that is hard and long or it can indicate any pulse that is associated with Excess. A Full pulse that is Rapid indicates an excess Hot condition. An Overflowing-Empty pulse usually indicates deficiency Heat. The expected tongue has a thick-yellow-dry coating. The Heat is reflected in the yellow coating with the Heat injuring the fluids producing a dry coating. The thickness reflects the severity of the pathogenic factor. Dry stools, burning anus, and thick-yellow-dry coating are sufficient to make the diagnosis of Large Intestine Heat. The treatment principle is Clear Heat in Large Intestine and Stomach and Promote Body Fluids. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 691; 2005 Edition, page 650; 1989 Edition, page 278",
      "exp_hant": "診斷為大腸熱。此證常因過食燥熱食物(羊肉、牛肉、酒精)而生。此為實熱證。乾燥乃因熱邪耗傷津液所致。此證預期脈象為實數脈。實脈可指脈形堅硬而長,亦可泛指任何與實證相關之脈象。實脈兼數則提示實熱證。洪虛脈則多提示虛熱。預期舌象為舌苔厚黃而乾。熱象反映於黃苔,熱邪傷津則苔燥。苔厚則反映病邪之嚴重程度。大便乾結、肛門灼熱及舌苔厚黃而乾已足以診斷大腸熱。治療原則為清大腸與胃熱、生津。《中醫基礎學》,Maciocia,2015年,第691頁;2005年版,第650頁;1989年版,第278頁。"
