      ],
      "exp_en": "The symptoms are due to a deficiency in the channel. The Small Intestine luo-connecting channel separates from the Small Intestine channel at SI-7 and connects to the Heart channel, ascends along the arms and connects with the shoulder at LI-15. The point actions for SI-7 are to clear heat and release the exterior, calm the Spirit, activate the channel and alleviate pain, and benefit the finger joints. Luo points treat disorders of their interior-exterior related channel or zang fu. SI-7 regulates and calms the Heart spirit. Luo points treat disorders in areas reached by the luo-connecting channel. SI-7 treats elbow contraction and loose shoulders. Luo points can treat psychological and emotional disorders. SI-7 treats manic-depression, fear and fright, sadness and anxiety, and restless zang disorder. Luo channels can be used to treat skin problems. In a full pattern you may see visible changes on the skin. The connecting channels can become congested and there can be a greenish discoloration indicating stasis, a blue skin color along the pathway indicating cold, a reddish color indicating heat, and a purple color indicating blood stasis. When the channel is palpated and feels hot or cold to the touch it can indicate a hot or cold condition. When there are venules and capillary congestion on the pathway of the connecting channel, these blood vessels can be pricked and bled to reduce the excess. When the connecting channel is empty, the connecting channel and its branches are void of qi. Nothing can be outwardly observed on the skin. However, in severe and chronic cases of luo-channel deficiencies there can be flaccidity of the muscles. Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 804, 853; 2005 Edition, page 760; A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 40, 41, 228, 238; Channels of Acupuncture, Maciocia, 2006, page 250, 258",
      "exp_hant": "此症狀乃因經絡虛損所致。小腸絡脈自支正穴分出,與心經相連,沿手臂上行,於肩部與肩髎(LI-15)相連。支正穴之作用為清熱解表、寧心安神、通經止痛、利指節。絡穴可治療其表裡相關經絡或臟腑之病症。支正穴能調理、安定心神。絡穴可治療絡脈循行所及部位之病症。支正穴治療肘部拘攣及肩部鬆弛無力。絡穴亦可治療心理與情志方面的疾患。支正穴治療癲狂、驚恐、憂愁焦慮及臟躁。絡脈亦可用於治療皮膚問題。實證中,皮膚上可見明顯變化。絡脈鬱滯時可見青色提示瘀滯,青色沿經絡循行提示寒,紅色提示熱,紫色提示血瘀。觸按經絡若覺灼熱或冰冷,可提示熱證或寒證。若絡脈循行處有靜脈曲張及微血管鬱血,可點刺放血以瀉其實。當絡脈虛時,絡脈及其分支氣血空虛,皮膚上通常無明顯外觀變化。然而,嚴重且長期的絡脈虛損病例可出現肌肉萎軟無力。《中醫基礎學》,Maciocia,2015年,第804、853頁;2005年版,第760頁;《針灸圖譜》,Deadman,第2版,第40、41、228、238頁;《針灸經絡學》,Maciocia,2006年,第250、258頁。"
    },
