      "exp_en": "The others are pathologies of the Five Element generating sequence. When the organs are balanced the Five Element (5E) generating sequence maintains the dynamic health of the body. The two ways that pathology can arise from an unbalanced generating sequence: 1) the Mother element does not nourish the Child element. 2) the Child element takes too much from the Mother element. Deficient Kidneys causing Heart Water Overflow is a pathology in the overacting sequence. Heart Blood Deficiency causing Liver Blood Deficiency is Fire affecting Wood. The reverse can happen with Wood (Liver Blood Xu) affecting Fire (Heart Blood Xu). Deficient Spleen causing Lung Phlegm Obstruction is Earth (Mother) affecting Metal (Child). The reverse can happen with Metal (Lung Qi Xu) affecting Earth (Spleen Qi Xu). Deficient Lung Qi causing Kidney Yin Deficiency is Metal (Mother) affecting Water (Child). The reverse can occur with Water (Kidneys fail to grasp the Qi) affecting Metal (Lung obstruction). Water and Wood can also have pathologies in the generating sequence of Water affecting Wood (Kidney Yin Deficiency causes Liver Blood Deficiency) or Wood affecting Water (Liver Blood does not replenish Kidney Essence). With the generating sequence of Fire and Earth one can have the Spleen (Child-Earth) affecting the Heart (Mother-Fire) with Spleen Qi Xu causing Heart Blood xu or you can have the Heart (Mother-Fire) affecting the Spleen (Child-Earth) with Heart Blood Xu affecting the Spleen capacity to concentrate and study. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 33",
      "exp_hant": "其餘選項皆屬於五行相生之病理。當臟腑平衡時,五行相生循環維繫人體動態健康。相生循環失衡而生病理的方式有二:1)母行不能滋養子行。2)子行過度耗奪母行。腎虛導致心水泛濫屬於相乘之病理。心血虛導致肝血虛屬火(母)影響木(子);反之亦可發生木(肝血虛)影響火(心血虛)。脾虛導致肺痰阻屬土(母)影響金(子);反之亦可發生金(肺氣虛)影響土(脾氣虛)。肺氣虛導致腎陰虛屬金(母)影響水(子);反之亦可發生水(腎不納氣)影響金(肺氣阻滯)。水與木之間亦可見相生病理,如水影響木(腎陰虛導致肝血虛)或木影響水(肝血不足以填補腎精)。火與土之相生關係中,可見脾(子-土)影響心(母-火),即脾氣虛導致心血虛;亦可見心(母-火)影響脾(子-土),即心血虛影響脾之思考與學習能力。《中醫基礎學》,Maciocia,2015年,第33頁。"
    },
