      "exp_en": "This is the most complete and accurate answer. The chong mai has a deep influence on Blood. The chong mai transforms Kidney-Essence into menstrual Blood (tian gui) and is connected to the Uterus. It is thus effective in gynecological disorders especially those involving Blood Stasis. The chong mai is THE vessel to use in GYN Blood Stasis cases (use SP-4 on right and PC-6 on left and then adding KI-14, SP-10, LR-3). There are two types of luo channels, superficial and deep, which the chong mai controls as the Sea of the 12 Channels. However, the superficial luo channels circulate wei qi while the deep luo are associated with Blood and Blood Vessels. Thus, the chong mai controls Blood aspect of the deep luo channels. Because of this connection, the chong mai can treat Blood Stasis disorders anywhere in the body, not just in the Uterus. When the Blood in the chong mai is abundant, the body hair is nourished and moistened. Because women lose menstrual Blood, they do not have beards (chong mai circles the lips) while men do. Because the chong mai is the Sea of Blood and spreads across the chest and since the Heart governs Blood, the chong mai can be selected to treat Heart disorders (palpitations, anxiety, irregular Heart rhythm) particularly during menopause. The upper point for the Sea of Blood is BL-11 and the lower points for the Sea of Blood are ST-37 and ST-39. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 907-908, 911",
      "exp_hant": "這是最完整且正確的答案。衝脈對血有深遠影響。衝脈能將腎精轉化為經血(天癸),並與胞宮相連,因此對於婦科疾患,尤其是涉及血瘀者,療效顯著。衝脈是治療婦科血瘀病症的首選經脈(取右三陰交、左內關,再加大赫(KI-14)、血海(SP-10)、太衝(LR-3))。絡脈有淺深兩種,衝脈作為十二經之海統攝之。然而,淺絡運行衛氣,深絡則與血及血脈相關。因此,衝脈統攝的是深絡的血分。因此,衝脈可治療全身各處之血瘀病症,不僅限於胞宮。當衝脈血液充盈時,毛髮得以滋養濡潤。由於女性因月經而耗損經血,故不長鬍鬚(衝脈環繞口唇),而男性則否。因衝脈為血海且散布於胸中,又因心主血,故衝脈可用以治療心臟疾患(心悸、焦慮、心律不整),尤其在更年期。血海之上穴為大杼(BL-11),下穴為上巨虛(ST-37)與下巨虛(ST-39)。《中醫基礎學》,Maciocia,2015年,第907-908、911頁。"
