      "exp_en": "The Small Intestine and Triple Burner muscle meridians both go to the head but they stay on one side. The Large Intestine muscle meridian goes to the front of the ear, goes up across the top of the head, and terminates at the mandible at the opposite side, like a set of headphones. This is an added explanation as to why LI-4 can treat headaches. Both the Triple Burner and Small Intestine muscle meridians go to the outer canthus. The yang muscle meridians of the arm start at their respective fingers similar to the primary meridians and follow a similar path. The Small Intestine muscle meridian follows the posterior aspect of the arm, surrounds the scapula, then enters the ear, binds the mastoid process, binds the mandible, binds the outer canthus and corner of the head. The Triple Burner muscle meridian follows the posterior aspect of the arm, binds at the elbow tip, goes to the neck, links with the root of the tongue, branches to the outer canthus, and binds to the corner of the head. The Large Intestine muscle meridian follows the lateral aspect of the arm, travels from the shoulder and attaches to the upper thoracic spine, and from the shoulder ascends to the neck, across the cheeks, binds at the side of the nose, crosses over the top of the head to connect with the opposite mandible. The Small Intestine muscle meridian connects with the Bladder, Large Intestine, Triple Burner, and Stomach muscle meridians. The Large Intestine muscle meridian connects with the Small Intestine, Bladder, and Stomach meridians. The Triple Burner muscle meridian connects with the Small Intestine muscle meridian. A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 98, 229, 389; The meridians of Acupuncture, Maciocia, 2006, page 303, 306",
      "exp_hant": "小腸經筋與三焦經筋雖皆到達頭部，但僅停留在同一側。大腸經筋則行至耳前，越過頭頂，終止於對側下頜，形似耳機一般跨越頭部兩側。這也進一步說明了為何合谷（LI-4）能治療頭痛。三焦經筋與小腸經筋皆到達目外眥。手部的陽經經筋皆起於相應的手指，其循行路徑與正經相似。小腸經筋沿上臂後側循行，繞肩胛，進入耳中，結於乳突，結於下頜，結於目外眥及頭角。三焦經筋沿上臂後側循行，結於肘尖，上至頸部，聯繫舌根，分支至目外眥，結於頭角。大腸經筋沿上臂外側循行，自肩部走行並連屬於上胸椎，再由肩部上行至頸部，橫過面頰，結於鼻旁，越過頭頂與對側下頜相連。小腸經筋與膀胱經筋、大腸經筋、三焦經筋及胃經筋相聯繫。大腸經筋與小腸經筋、膀胱經筋及胃經筋相聯繫。三焦經筋則與小腸經筋相聯繫。A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 98, 229, 389; The meridians of Acupuncture, Maciocia, 2006, page 303, 306"
