      "exp_en": "The treatment strategy treating both the root (Spleen Yang Deficiency) and manifestation (frequent diarrhea) is often used in practice with elderly patients. In a relatively healthy and young patient it would be sufficient to treat the manifestation (severe diarrhea) but in an elderly patient whose overall qi is weak, it is necessary to treat both. If this patient had very SEVERE diarrhea, then you would focus on treating the manifestation (diarrhea) first and then the root later. Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 1176-1177; 2005 Edition, page 1120",
      "exp_hant": "同時治療本（脾陽虛）與標（頻繁腹瀉）的治療策略，在臨床上常用於年邁患者。對於相對健康的年輕患者，僅治標（嚴重腹瀉）即已足夠，但對於整體氣虛的年邁患者，則須標本兼治。若此患者腹瀉極為嚴重，則應先著重治標（腹瀉），之後再治本。Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 1176-1177; 2005 Edition, page 1120"
