    {
      "number": 343,
      "question_en": "What is the recommendation from the \"Great Compendium of Acupuncture\" regarding the needling of points associated with the Extraordinary Vessels?",
      "question_hant": "《針灸大成》對於奇經八脈相關穴位的針刺方法有何建議？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
