      "exp_en": "The channel patterns of symptoms and signs are from the Ling Shu (The Spiritual Axis) which is the second part of the Yellow Emperor's Inner Canon, with the other part known as the Su Wen, Basic Questions. The symptoms and signs for the channel patterns can be confusing because they can include not only organ symptoms related to the channel but also symptoms from the organs. When you see organ symptoms in channel patterns, what needs to be decided is whether it would be best to do an organ pattern differentiation to treat the organ. For example, if a channel pattern has the symptoms of cough and asthma but the patient also has chest oppression, profuse white sputum, and a sticky white tongue coating, then it would more effective to treat the organ pattern (damp-phlegm obstructing the Lungs, in this example) then it would be to treat the channel. The list of symptoms which Maciocia gives for channel patterns omits internal organ symptoms. The list that he uses is limited only to mainly on the channel symptoms and signs. Pain, numbness, stiffness, or tingling along a channel pathway is indicative of a disorder of that channel. Full channel patterns include pain, stiffness, contractions, cramps. Empty channel patterns have dull pain, weak limbs, atrophy of the muscles, and numbness. Color changes in pathway of the channels heat (red), blue (cold), qi stasis (greenish), or blood stasis (purplish). If there is heat the skin on the channel pathway will be hot to the touch. An empty channel pattern can feel cold with a pale streak along the pathway. Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 796, 797",
      "exp_hant": "經絡病證之症狀與體徵出自《靈樞》(《黃帝內經》的第二部分,另一部分則為《素問》)。經絡病證的症狀與體徵有時會令人混淆,因其中不僅包含與該經相關的臟腑症狀,也包含臟腑本身之症狀。當經絡病證中出現臟腑症狀時,需判斷是否應改以臟腑辨證來治療該臟腑。舉例而言,若經絡病證出現咳嗽及哮喘症狀,但患者同時有胸悶、痰白量多、舌苔白膩,則治療臟腑證(此例中為痰濕阻肺)會比僅治經絡更為有效。Maciocia所列之經絡病證症狀清單,省略了內臟症狀,其所用清單主要僅限於經絡本身之症狀與體徵。沿經絡循行路徑出現疼痛、麻木、僵硬或刺痛感,皆顯示該經失調。實證經絡病包括疼痛、僵硬、拘攣、抽筋。虛證經絡病則有隱痛、肢體無力、肌肉萎縮及麻木。經絡循行部位之顏色變化:熱(紅)、寒(青)、氣滯(偏綠)或血瘀(偏紫)。若有熱,經絡循行部位皮膚觸之發熱。虛證經絡病可觸感發涼,並沿循行部位出現蒼白條紋。Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 796, 797"
    },
    {
      "number": 391,
      "question_en": "A 45 year-old female patient has had abdominal pain and umbilical pain for the past ten years. The abdominal pain was associated with distention, made worse after eating, after emotional stress, and when tired. The abdominal pain improved with pressure, by resting, and by application of heat. The abdominal pain extended to the hypogastric area where the pain was worse while lifting heavy objects. She was slightly constipated. She had a weak and weepy voice. Her eyes had no brightness and she looked and sounded sad. Her tongue was very red and redder on the sides and tip. The tongue coating was yellow. The pulse was very weak-minute and a little wiry on the left side. The treatment principle that was selected was Nourish Liver and Kidney Yin and Clear Empty Fire. After five sessions there was some improvement but only lasted a couple of hours after each treatment. What treatment would you now choose?",
      "question_hant": "一名45歲女性患者,腹痛及臍周疼痛已十年。腹痛伴有腹脹,於進食後、情緒壓力後及疲勞時加重。腹痛按之則減、休息及熱敷後亦可緩解。腹痛延伸至小腹部,提重物時加劇。她略有便秘。她的聲音虛弱且帶哭腔。雙眼無神,神情與語氣皆顯悲傷。舌色甚紅,舌邊尖更紅。舌苔黃。脈極弱細微,左側略弦。原先選定之治療原則為滋養肝腎之陰、清虛火。經五次治療後略有改善,但每次治療後僅維持數小時。此時您會選擇何種治療方案?",
