      "exp_en": "Wind-Heat has aversion to cold, sweating, and fever a Latent Heat can have slight sweating. Wind-Heat can easily be transmitted to the Pericardium while Latent Heat can easily consume qi and yin. Wind-Heat has a floating-rapid pulse while Latent Heat has a wiry, rapid or intermittent pulse. Wind-Heat has a thin white tongue coating while Latent Heat has a red tongue from the beginning. Latent Heat occurs when an external pathogen bypasses the wei qi and penetrates the body, incubates internally, and later manifests. Only Wind-Heat has aversion to cold, sweating, and fever while Latent Heat can have slight sweating. However, a new external invasion of wind-heat can trigger the Latent Heat to surface. In which symptoms from both patterns will manifest. You can tell by the tongue which will be red (Latent Heat) instead of seeing the white coating in Wind-Heat. Wind-Heat can have cough but not Latent Heat. Wind-Heat can progress to Heat at the Qi level and then this internal Heat can affect the Pericardium at the Nutritive Qi level. Latent Heat can incubate internally for long periods of time can end up consuming the yin and qi. Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 781",
      "exp_hant": "風熱有惡寒、汗出與發熱，而伏熱則可能僅有輕微汗出。風熱容易傳入心包，而伏熱則容易耗傷氣陰。風熱脈象浮數，伏熱脈象則為弦數或結代。風熱舌苔薄白，伏熱則從一開始舌質即紅。伏熱是指外邪未經衛氣層次直接侵入人體，潛伏於內，日後方才發病。只有風熱會有惡寒、汗出與發熱，伏熱則僅可能有輕微汗出。然而，新感風熱外邪可誘發伏熱外顯，此時兩證的症狀會同時出現。此時可從舌象加以區分：伏熱舌質紅，而非風熱所見之白苔。風熱可有咳嗽，伏熱則無咳嗽。風熱可傳變為氣分熱，此內熱再進一步可於營分階段影響心包。伏熱可在體內潛伏甚久，最終耗傷陰與氣。《中醫基礎學》，Maciocia，2015年，第781頁"
    },
