      "exp_en": "This pattern is a mixed Shi and Xu pattern that is comprised of severe Kidney Yin Deficiency (xu) with Empty-Heat that blazes (shi). This pattern involves Kidney Yin Deficiency (dizziness, tinnitus, poor memory, dryness, night sweating, lassitude, depression, back pain, constipation, scanty urine, tongue without coating, and a floating-empty pulse) which generates Empty-Heat Blazing that affects the Mind (mental restlessness, insomnia), the face (malar flush), temperature (low-grade fever, hot flashes), the throat (dry throat at night, thirst with sipping), the Bladder (dark urine, blood in urine), and genitals (nocturnal emissions with dreams, excess sexual drive). The insomnia in this pattern manifests as difficulty falling asleep and waking up several times or waking up too early. It is enough just to have tinnitus and a tongue without coating to be able to make this diagnosis. The treatment principle is Nourish Kidney Yin, Clear Empty-Heat, and Calm Shen. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 638; 2005 Edition, page 603; 1989 Edition, page 258",
      "exp_hant": "此證為虛實夾雜之證，乃嚴重腎陰虛（虛）並見虛熱熾盛（實）所致。此證包含腎陰虛（頭暈、耳鳴、健忘、口乾、盜汗、倦怠、情緒低落、腰痛、便秘、小便短少、舌無苔、脈浮虛）而生虛熱熾盛，影響心神（心神不寧、失眠）、顏面（顴紅）、體溫（低熱、潮熱）、咽喉（夜間咽乾、口渴喜少量飲水）、膀胱（小便深黃、尿血），以及生殖器官（夢遺、性慾亢進）。此證之失眠表現為入睡困難、夜間多次醒轉或早醒。僅需耳鳴與舌無苔即足以診斷此證。治療原則為滋腎陰、清虛熱、安神。《中醫基礎學》，Maciocia，2015年，第638頁；2005年版，第603頁；1989年版，第258頁"
    },
