      "exp_en": "TCM has no disorder that corresponds to ITP. In TCM, internal pathogens can hide inside the body and can, over the long term, generate heat and toxins that can lead to blood disorders. The internal heat can then consume the body fluids and can result in either blood stasis and/or the heat can cause abnormal blood flow to circulate and spill out of blood vessels and collaterals. Cases can also have Spleen xu which allows the blood to leak out of vessels to become purpura. This is a chronic case that indicates the presence of blood stasis combined with deficiency of qi. In this case the chronic IPT symptoms are due to blood stasis obstructing the collaterals while the underlying pathology is that of deficiency of qi. Once blood flows outside of the vessels and collaterals it can result in blood stasis. The dark-purple tongue with black spots and the scanty-dark menstruation both indicate the presence of blood stasis. The symptoms of mental fatigue, lack of strength, poor appetite, and the deep-thready-weak pulse point to the bleeding due to deficient qi failing to contain the blood. The hot flashes at night indicates a deficiency of yin. The overall pathology that explains IPT in this case is both blood stasis obstruction and qi deficiency. In TCM, ITP requires treating both the branch and root simultaneously. In a chronic case, treatment of the root (deficient qi) is emphasized while treating the branch (blood stasis) is given less of an emphasis but both are treated. The treatment principle is to primarily Boost qi to control the blood and secondarily to invigorate blood to break up blood stasis. TCM Case Studies: Autoimmune Disease, Sheng-ping, Fratkin, and Jing, 2014, page 138-139",
      "exp_hant": "中醫並無與ITP完全對應之病名。中醫認為，內在病邪可潛伏於體內，日久化生熱毒，進而導致血證。內熱可耗傷津液，並可導致血瘀，或使血液異常運行而溢出脈絡之外。此類病例亦可能兼有脾虛，使血液不循常道而外溢，形成紫斑。此為慢性病例，顯示存在血瘀兼氣虛。此案慢性ITP之症狀乃因血瘀阻絡所致，而其根本病機則為氣虛。血液一旦溢出脈絡之外，即可形成血瘀。舌質暗紫伴黑斑，以及月經量少色暗，均為血瘀之徵象。精神疲憊、體力不足、食慾不振及脈沉細弱，則指向氣虛不能攝血而致出血。夜間潮熱則顯示陰虛。此案ITP整體病機為血瘀阻絡兼氣虛。中醫治療ITP須標本同治：慢性病例宜著重治本（補氣），治標（活血化瘀）為輔，但兩者皆須兼顧。治療原則為以益氣攝血為主，佐以活血化瘀。《中醫案例研究：自體免疫疾病》，Sheng-ping、Fratkin與Jing合著，2014年，第138-139頁"
