    {
      "number": 452,
      "question_en": "The three positions of the pulse (front, middle, rear) can be interpreted in different ways. How can these three positions be assessed?",
      "question_hant": "脈診中的三部（寸、關、尺）可從不同角度加以詮釋。這三個部位可如何進行評估？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
