      "exp_en": "The Spleen muscle meridian follows the medial aspect of the leg, converges at the genitals, binds at the navel, binds at the ribs and spreads to the chest, and adheres to the spine. The Spleen muscle meridian adhering to the spine explains the selection of SP-3 in the treatment of lumbar pain. The Spleen muscle meridian connects with the Liver and Kidney muscle meridians. The Liver muscle meridian follows the medial aspect of the leg and connects with the genitals where it ends. The Liver luo-connecting meridian also connects to the genitals. This shows the importance of the Liver meridians in the treatment of genital problems. The Liver muscle meridian connects with the Spleen muscle meridian at the genitals. The Kidney muscle meridian travels the medial aspect of the leg, binds at the genitals, ascends to the inner aspect of the spine, and binds at the occipital bone. The Kidney muscle meridian connects with the Spleen and Bladder muscle meridians. The Kidney muscle meridian joins with the Bladder muscle meridian at the occiput. The Kidney luo-connecting meridian also connects at the nape of neck. This shows the importance of the Bladder and Kidney meridians in treating the spine and back of neck. A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 180, 334, 471; The meridians of Acupuncture, Maciocia, 2006, page 297-300",
      "exp_hant": "脾之經筋循行於下肢內側，會聚於陰部，結於臍部，再結於肋部並散布於胸部，最終附著於脊柱。脾經筋附著於脊柱一事，說明了太白（SP-3）常用於治療腰痛的原因。脾經筋與肝、腎之經筋相連。肝之經筋循行於下肢內側，並連於陰部，於此終止。肝之絡脈亦連於陰部，顯示肝經在治療生殖器官病症上的重要性。肝經筋於陰部與脾經筋相連。腎之經筋循行於下肢內側，結於陰部，上行至脊柱內側，並結於枕骨。腎經筋與脾、膀胱之經筋相連，並於枕部與膀胱經筋相會。腎之絡脈亦於項部相連，顯示膀胱經與腎經在治療脊柱及項背病症上的重要性。《針灸學手冊》，Deadman，第二版，第180、334、471頁；《經絡學》，Maciocia，2006年，第297-300頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 465,
      "question_en": "A patient has mental restlessness, palpitations, bitter taste, insomnia, sleep disturbed by dreams, chest oppression, mental confusion, rattling sound in throat, incoherent speech, inappropriate laughter or crying, mental depression, red-swollen tongue with dry-sticky-yellow coating, and a full-rapid-slippery pulse. What is the Heart zang-fu pattern?",
      "question_hant": "患者心神不寧、心悸、口苦、失眠、多夢、胸悶、神志不清、喉中痰鳴、言語錯亂、無故哭笑、情緒抑鬱，舌紅腫、苔黃膩而乾，脈實數而滑。此屬何種心的臟腑證型？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Heart yin deficiency",
          "hant": "心陰虛",
          "correct": false
