        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "Phlegm-fire harassing the heart",
          "hant": "痰火擾心",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "Heart fire blazing",
          "hant": "心火熾盛",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "Phlegm misting the mind",
          "hant": "痰迷心竅",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "This is an Internal, Hot, and Full pattern. The Heart is being agitated with Fire (palpitations, red face, bitter taste, dream disturbed sleep, agitation, mental restlessness, rapid pulse, red tongue) and obstructed by Phlegm (throat rattling, chest oppression, slippery pulse, thick tongue coating). The Phlegm is produced by a deficient Spleen Qi unable to transform-transport fluids which leads to Phlegm accumulation . It is the Phlegm obstructing the Heart which disturbs the Shen and generates mental symptoms. This pattern describes manic-depression where Fire and Phlegm impact the Heart. The mania symptoms (uncontrolled laughter, hitting/scolding people, rash behavior, incoherent speech) can alternate with the symptoms of depression (dullness, self-muttering, depression). This pattern can occur in patients not being diagnosed with bipolar disorder. The difference between the pattern of Heart Fire and Phlegm-Fire Harassing the Heart is that in the former pattern the Shen is not clouded and has no loss of insight while with the latter pattern the Shen is dull and lacks insight. The treatment principle is to Clear the Heart, Drain Fire, Resolve Phlegm, Calm Shen, and Open the Heart Orifices. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 502; 2005 Edition, page 474; 1989 Edition, page 209",
      "exp_hant": "此為裡、熱、實之證。心受火擾（心悸、面赤、口苦、多夢、躁動、心神不寧、脈數、舌紅），並受痰所阻（喉中痰鳴、胸悶、脈滑、舌苔厚）。此痰乃因脾氣虛不能運化輸布津液，致使痰濕積聚而生。正是痰阻於心，擾亂心神，因而產生精神方面的症狀。此證描述的是躁鬱狀態，即火與痰同時影響於心。躁狂症狀（狂笑不止、打人罵人、行為輕率、言語錯亂）可與抑鬱症狀（呆滯、自言自語、情緒低落）交替出現。此證亦可見於未被診斷為躁鬱症的患者。心火與痰火擾心兩證的區別在於：前者神志不昏矇，並無失去自知力；後者則神志呆滯，失去自知力。治療原則為清心瀉火、化痰、安神、開心竅。《中醫基礎學》，Maciocia，2015年，第502頁；2005年版，第474頁；1989年版，第209頁"
    },
