    {
      "number": 467,
      "question_en": "A patient has poor appetite, fatigue, and loose stools. What is the treatment plan?",
      "question_hant": "患者食慾不振、疲倦、大便溏薄。治療原則為何？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Tonify Spleen Qi, Tonify Lung Qi",
