      "exp_en": "The Spleen-Stomach are the main source for Blood production where food qi (gu qi) is eventually transformed into Blood with the aid of yuan qi (original qi). The Kidneys store jing which produces Marrow which then becomes transformed into bone marrow that helps to generate Blood. The Pre-Heaven Qi (Kidneys) interact with the Post-Heaven Qi (Stomach and Spleen) to help generate Blood. The Lung Qi plays a part by sending the food-qi to the Heart and food-qi is transformed into Blood in the Heart. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 61; 2005 Edition, page 60, 62; 1989 Edition, page 49",
      "exp_hant": "脾胃為生血之主要來源，食氣（穀氣）在元氣的協助下最終化生為血。腎藏精，精化為髓，髓再轉化為骨髓以協助生血。先天之氣（腎）與後天之氣（脾胃）相互作用而助生血。肺氣則透過將食氣輸送至心，並於心中化為血，發揮其作用。《中醫基礎學》，Maciocia，2015年，第61頁；2005年版，第60、62頁；1989年版，第49頁"
