      "exp_en": "There is only one qi. This one qi has a different name depending on its location and function. For example, when this qi flows on the exterior of the body it is called wei qi. When it flows in the interior of the body it is called ying qi. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 45; 2005 Edition, page 43; 1989 Edition, page 37",
      "exp_hant": "氣本為一，此一氣依其所在部位與功能不同，而有不同的名稱。舉例來說，當此氣運行於體表時，稱為衛氣；當此氣運行於體內時，則稱為營氣。《中醫基礎學》，Maciocia，2015年，第45頁；2005年版，第43頁；1989年版，第37頁"
