      "exp_en": "This is the most complete and accurate answer. It is the Lung's function of diffusion, not the Kidneys, is responsible for moving fluids to the space under the skin. Kidney yang provides heat to the Spleen for its fluid transformation function. The Kidneys help the Small Intestine separate pure from impure fluids. The Kidney qi helps the Bladder with qi transformation. And the Kidneys help the San Jiao to transform and excrete fluids. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 67; 2005 Edition, page 65; 1989 Edition, page 53",
