    {
      "number": 501,
      "question_en": "The Five Element model of correspondences is",
      "question_hant": "五行對應模型是",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "an eclectic model",
          "hant": "一種折衷式模型",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "a changing model",
          "hant": "一種變動的模型",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "a rigid model",
          "hant": "一種僵化固定的模型",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "an adaptable model",
          "hant": "一種可調整適應的模型",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "One of the limitations of the Five Element (5E) model of correspondences is that it is rigid and fixed. It tries to fit all phenomenon to a five-fold classification system. The 5E model says Fire belongs to the Heart. From an organ view Fire originates from Kidney Yang (Gate of Life) that actually provides the Heart with Fire. The 5E model says that the eyes belong to Wood. From an organ view the eyes are not only associated with the Liver (moistens the eyes) but also with Kidney yin (moistens the eyes), the Heart (through the luo-connecting channel). The 5E model says that the tongue belongs to the Heart. From an organ view, in tongue diagnosis all of the elements-organs manifest on the tongue. The 5E model says that the ears belong to Water. From an organ view, the ears are related to Kidney Essence nourishing the ear but acute ear problems (tinnitus, deafness) can be related to the Gall Bladder channel. The 5E model is useful in seeing one-to-one correspondences (eg Kidneys - ears, Liver -eyes).",
      "exp_hant": "五行對應模型的其中一項限制，在於它是僵化固定的，試圖將一切現象都套入五分類的架構之中。五行模型認為火屬心；但從臟腑的角度來看，火其實源自腎陽（命門之火），是命門之火提供心以火。五行模型認為目屬木；但從臟腑角度來看，眼睛不僅與肝（濡養眼睛）有關，亦與腎陰（濡養眼睛）及心（透過絡脈）有關。五行模型認為舌屬心；但從臟腑角度來看，在舌診中所有五行臟腑皆會顯現於舌。五行模型認為耳屬水；但從臟腑角度來看，耳與腎精滋養耳竅有關，然而急性耳病（如耳鳴、耳聾）則可能與膽經有關。五行模型的用處在於呈現一對一的對應關係（例如腎－耳、肝－目）。"
    },
