      "exp_en": "This is the most complete and accurate answer. Skin palpation is employed to assess skin temperature, skin moisture, and skin texture. Also assessed is the consistency of deeper tissues and to detect the presence of masses. The skin, the hands and feet, the chest, the abdomen, and acupuncture channels and points are palpated in the assessment of the Cutaneous Regions. There are three energetic layers when palpating the skin: the skin, muscles and blood vessels, and sinews and bones. Lightly touching the skin is used to detect skin temperature (hot, cold) and skin moisture (sweat, dryness). Detecting sweating is important in external wind attacks. In stroking the skin is done via stroking the skin on the chest, abdomen, and limbs to determine areas of tenderness, areas of swelling, and to differentiate between excess and deficiency. Pressing the skin is pressing the skin with deep pressure to assess deeper levels and is used in the abdomen to help determine excess, deficiency, and the presence of masses. Stroking the skin assesses the skin. Stroking the skin assesses the flesh and muscles. Pressing the skin assesses the bones, joints, and internal organs. In assessing temperature, touching the skin is used to detect Empty-Heat or Wind-Heat. Stroking the skin is used to detect interior heat in the Spleen or Heart. Pressing the skin is used to detect Empty-Heat arising from Liver Yin Xu or Kidney Yin Xu. The Channels of Acupuncture, Maciocia, 2006, page 362",
      "exp_hant": "此為最完整且準確的答案。皮膚觸診用以評估皮膚溫度、皮膚濕潤度及皮膚質地，同時也評估深層組織的軟硬度，並偵測是否有腫塊存在。在評估皮部時，需觸診皮膚、手足、胸部、腹部，以及經絡與穴位。觸診皮膚時有三個能量層次：皮膚、肌肉與血脈，以及筋骨。輕觸皮膚用以偵測皮膚溫度（發熱、發冷）及皮膚濕潤度（有汗、乾燥），偵測有汗與否在外感風邪時尤為重要。循皮則是在胸、腹及四肢上循摸皮膚，以判斷壓痛部位、腫脹部位，並分辨虛實。按皮則是以深按的方式評估較深層次，多用於腹部，以協助判斷虛實及是否有腫塊。循皮評估的是皮膚；循皮亦評估肌肉；按皮則評估骨骼、關節及內臟。在評估溫度方面，觸皮用以偵測虛熱或風熱；循皮用以偵測脾或心的裡熱；按皮則用以偵測由肝陰虛或腎陰虛所生的虛熱。The Channels of Acupuncture, Maciocia, 2006, page 362"
