      "exp_en": "It is the chong mai that is associated with an accumulation of a material type (Blood, Phlegm, food) while the ren mai is associated more with qi deficiency and qi stasis. That is, the ren mai is more related to qi (deficiency of qi, qi stasis) while the chong mai is more related to Blood (Blood stasis) and rebellious qi the chong mai. But the ren mai can also be used for Blood stasis when the Blood stasis is caused by qi disorders. The ren mai is connected to qi via the Lungs while the chong mai is connected to Blood via the Spleen and Heart. The chong mai flows around the Heart which is connected to the Uterus via the Uterus Vessel (bao mai). The ren mai treats asthma due to a deficiency of the Lungs and Kidneys while the chong mai treats excess type of asthma (Phlegm, Rebellious Qi). Maciocia chooses the ren mai when the pulse is weak, thin, short, or fine (all deficiency pulses) and the chong mai when the pulse is slippery, full, long, wiry, and firm (all excess pulses). In the GYN area, the ren mai is selected for problems due to conception, fertility, pregnancy, and menopause and menstrual disorders arising from qi disorders. In the GYN area, the chong mai is selected more for menstrual disorders due to Blood stasis (painful periods). The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 912, 914",
      "exp_hant": "衝脈與有形物質的積聚（血、痰、食）較為相關，而任脈則較與氣虛及氣滯相關。也就是說，任脈較關乎氣（氣虛、氣滯），而衝脈則較關乎血（血瘀）及衝脈本身的氣逆。然而，當血瘀是由氣的失調所引起時，任脈亦可用以治療血瘀。任脈透過肺與氣相連，衝脈則透過脾與心與血相連。衝脈環繞心而行，而心又透過胞脈與子宮相連。任脈治療因肺腎虧虛所致的氣喘，衝脈則治療實證型氣喘（痰、氣逆）。馬萬里（Maciocia）在脈象呈現細弱、短或濡弱等虛脈時選用任脈，而在脈象呈現滑、實、長、弦、緊等實脈時則選用衝脈。在婦科方面，任脈用於受孕、生育力、妊娠，以及由氣的失調所引起的更年期與月經失調等問題；衝脈則較常用於因血瘀所致的月經失調（痛經）。The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 912, 914"
