      "exp_en": "The diagnosis is Phlegm-Fire Harassing the Heart. Phlegm produces a yellow-sticky coating while Heat produces a red tongue. The coating is dry as a result of the Heat consuming Body Fluids. A swollen tongue can be caused by a deficiency which causes fluids to not move and accumulate resulting in a swollen tongue. In this case, the swollen tongue is due to an excess of Heat which accumulates in the tongue. What differentiates a swollen tongue due to deficiency or excess is the tongue color. The pulse in this pattern is full-slippery or rapid-overflowing-slippery or rapid-full-wiry. The key symptoms are mental symptoms (agitation, incoherent speech, tendency to scold/hit people, uncontrolled laughing and crying, shouting, manic behavior, depression) and red tongue with sticky-yellow coating. The treatment principle is Clear the Heart, Drain Fire, Resolve Phlegm, and Open the Orifices of the Mind. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 502; 2005 Edition, page 474; 1989 Edition, page 209",
      "exp_hant": "此證為痰火擾心。痰使苔呈黃膩，熱則使舌質紅。苔乾則是因為熱邪耗傷津液所致。舌胖大可由虛損導致津液運行不暢而積聚所引起；但本案例中的舌胖大，則是因熱邪過盛積聚於舌所致。區分虛實所致舌胖大的關鍵在於舌色。此證的脈象為實滑、數而洪滑，或數而實弦。關鍵症狀為神志症狀（躁動不安、言語錯亂、易罵詈毆人、哭笑無常、喊叫、躁狂行為、抑鬱）及舌紅苔黃膩。治療原則為清心瀉火、化痰開竅醒神。The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 502; 2005 Edition, page 474; 1989 Edition, page 209"
