      "number": 540,
      "question_en": "A 72 year-old patient complains of chronic headaches. She also reports shortness of breath and sweating with light exertion. Which \"yes\" answer to the following questions helps to confirm the diagnosis?",
      "question_hant": "一名72歲病患主訴慢性頭痛，並訴稍微活動即出現氣短及汗出。下列問題中，回答「是」有助於確認診斷的是？",
