          "en": "Does the headache wake you up during sleep?",
          "hant": "頭痛是否會在睡眠中將你痛醒？",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "Does the headache worsen with stress?",
          "hant": "頭痛是否會因壓力而加重？",
