      "exp_en": "When a woman who is not having a period has either a profuse amount of bleeding from the yin passage vagina or there is blood drip/spotting or there is incessant bleeding, then this is called \"flooding and spotting\". Spotting and flooding are clinically difficult to separate as they often occur together. The associated patterns are Blood Heat flooding and spotting, Qi Vacuity flooding and spotting, and Blood Stasis flooding and spotting. In Blood Heat the amount of deep-red blood is profuse, acute, forceful, and continues for a long period of time. This is associated with other symptoms and signs that point to Repletion Heat (red tongue, rapid pulse, thirst, etc). With Qi Vacuity the pale-red blood can be profuse or can last a long time. This is associated with other symptoms and signs that to point to Qi Vacuity (pale tongue, fatigue, SOB, vacuous pulse, etc). With Blood Stasis, there is purplish-red blood with clots and abdominal pain that dislikes pressure. If the flooding and spotting continue for a long time the repletion patterns of Blood Heat and Blood Stasis can transform into vacuity patterns due to the profuse blood loss. Also, if the flooding and spotting due to vacuity continues for an extended period, the vacuity can worsen and begin to develop yin or yang vacuity. Practical Diagnosis in Traditional Chinese Medicine, Deng, 1999, page 361",
      "exp_hant": "當女性並非行經期間，卻從陰道大量出血，或呈點滴漏下，或出血淋漓不止，此即稱為「崩漏」。崩與漏在臨床上難以截然區分，因兩者常同時出現。相關證型包括血熱崩漏、氣虛崩漏及血瘀崩漏。血熱者，出血量多、色深紅、來勢急、勢猛且持續時間長，並伴有其他顯示實熱的症狀與體徵（舌紅、脈數、口渴等）。氣虛者，出血色淡紅，量可多亦可久淋不止，並伴有其他顯示氣虛的症狀與體徵（舌淡、疲倦、氣短、脈虛等）。血瘀者，出血色紫紅，夾有血塊，並伴有拒按的腹痛。若崩漏持續日久，血熱與血瘀等實證，可因失血過多而轉化為虛證。此外，若因虛而致的崩漏持續日久，虛損可加重，並進一步發展為陰虛或陽虛。Practical Diagnosis in Traditional Chinese Medicine, Deng, 1999, page 361"
