      "exp_en": "The diagnosis is Stomach Qi Deficiency. A pale tongue can have different shades varying from a little paler than a normal tongue to almost white in a severe disharmony. How pale the tongue is can give a clue as to prognosis. A pale tongue can be the result of either insufficient Blood or can be the result of qi failing to move and supply Blood to the tongue which is the case in this pattern. The pulse in this pattern is empty, especially on the right middle position. Feeling tired in the morning and a weak Stomach pulse are sufficient to make the diagnosis of Stomach Qi Deficiency. The treatment principle is Tonify Stomach Qi. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 655; 2005 Edition, page 619; 1989 Edition, page 267",
      "exp_hant": "此證為胃氣虛。舌淡的程度可有不同深淺，從略淺於正常舌色，到嚴重失調時近乎全白皆有可能，舌色的淺淡程度可作為預後的線索。舌淡可因血不足所致，亦可因氣無法推動血上榮於舌所致，本案例即屬後者。此證的脈象為虛脈，尤以右關部為甚。晨起倦怠及胃脈虛弱，即足以診斷胃氣虛。治療原則為補胃氣。The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 655; 2005 Edition, page 619; 1989 Edition, page 267"
