      "exp_en": "The symptoms are due to an excess in the channel. Full conditions in the luo channels can arise from external pathogenic factors or from acute qi and blood stasis. In the symptoms of feeling of chest distention in the chest or diaphragm there is qi stagnation in the luo channel. The Heart luo-connecting channel separates from the Heart at HT-5 and connects with the Small Intestine channel, follows the Heart channel to the Heart zang and then continues to the root of the tongue. The point actions for HT-5 are to calm the Spirit, regulate heart rhythm, benefit the tongue, and activate the channel and alleviate pain. Luo points treat disorders of their interior-exterior related channel or zang fu. HT-5 treats elbow and upper arm pain, and painful wrists. Luo points treat disorders in areas reached by the luo-connecting channel. HT-5 treats stiffness of the tongue, and speech disorders especially after a stroke. Luo points can treat psychological and emotional disorders. HT-5 treats frequent yawning and groaning with sadness, anger, sadness and fright, agitation with a burning sensation in the heart, and depression. Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 804; 2005 Edition, page 760; A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 210, 216; Channels of Acupuncture, Maciocia, 2006, page 250, 258",
      "exp_hant": "此症狀是由於經絡實證所致。絡脈的實證可源於外邪侵襲，或急性的氣血瘀滯。胸中或膈部脹滿感，即顯示絡脈中的氣滯。心絡脈由通里（HT-5）處與心之正經分出，連結小腸經，並沿心經行至心臟，再繼續行至舌根。通里（HT-5）的穴位作用為安神、調節心律、利舌，以及疏通經絡、止痛。絡穴可治療其互為表裡經絡或臟腑的病症，通里（HT-5）可治療肘部及上臂疼痛，以及腕部疼痛。絡穴可治療絡脈所到達區域的病症，通里（HT-5）可治療舌強及言語障礙，尤其是中風之後的言語障礙。絡穴亦可治療心理及情志方面的疾病，通里（HT-5）可治療多欠伸、悲傷伴呻吟、易怒、悲傷與驚恐、心中煩熱躁動，以及抑鬱。Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 804; 2005 Edition, page 760; A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 210, 216; Channels of Acupuncture, Maciocia, 2006, page 250, 258"
    },
