    {
      "number": 560,
      "question_en": "One way of looking at the sanjiao is that it refers to three divisions of the body. The Liver is energetically located in which burner(s)?",
      "question_hant": "理解三焦的其中一種方式，是將其視為身體的三個分區。從能量角度而言，肝臟位於哪一焦（哪些焦）？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Middle Burner",
          "hant": "中焦",
