      "question_en": "The side effects of anti-muscarinic (scopolamine, atropine) drugs can induce which of the following TCM patterns?",
      "question_hant": "抗毒蕈鹼藥物（東莨菪鹼、阿托品）的副作用可能誘發下列哪一種中醫證型？",
