      "exp_en": "Androgen containing agents are used to treat hypogonadism, osteoporosis, and for speeding healing from burns and wounds. Androgen agents are posited to be yang supplementing medicinals. The side effects of these agents include acne, facial hair, and baldness. An excess of yang damage the yin which can then lead to a hyperactivity of ministerial Fire. As men have more yang qi, the Blood in men moves upward to the face and produce facial hair. In women the Blood moves downward to produce menstruation and nourish the fetus. An increase of ministerial Fire can increase facial hair. In TCM baldness can also be due to an hyperactivity of ministerial Fire or excess yang rising to the head damaging Blood and drying up the scalp. The acne is due to the vacuity Fire lodging in the Blood. Integrated Pharmacology, Sperber and Flaws, 2007, page 364",
      "exp_hant": "含雄性激素的藥物用於治療性腺功能低下、骨質疏鬆症，並可加速燒燙傷與創傷的癒合。雄性激素藥物被視為溫補陽氣之品。此類藥物的副作用包括痤瘡、體毛增多與禿髮。陽氣過盛可耗傷陰液，進而導致相火亢盛。由於男子陽氣較盛，血隨陽氣上行於面而生鬍鬚；女子則血下行以化生月經並濡養胎兒。相火增盛可使體毛增多。中醫認為禿髮亦可因相火亢盛或陽氣過亢上衝頭部，耗傷陰血、燥涸頭皮所致。痤瘡則因虛火留滯血分所致。Integrated Pharmacology, Sperber and Flaws, 2007, page 364"
