      "exp_en": "The symptoms are due to a deficiency in the channel. The Large Intestine luo-connecting channel starts at LI-6, joins with its interior-exterior Lung channel three cun above the wrist, ascends the arm to LI-15 and then to the jaw and cheek where it splits with one branch connecting to the teeth and the other branch entering the ear. The Stomach, Small Intestine, Gall Bladder, and Triple Burner channels also gather and collect at the ear. LI-6 expels wind and clears heat, and opens and regulates the water passages. LI-6 as a luo point treats tooth decay, cold teeth, tinnitus, deafness, mouth deviation, swollen cheeks, dim vision, and pain in the wrist, elbow, and upper arm. Luo points treat disorders of their interior-exterior related channel or zang fu. LI-6 treats acute edema which occurs when external wind disrupts the Lung function of regulating the water passages. Luo points treat disorders in areas reached by the luo-connecting channel. The Large Intestine luo channel ascends to the ears and LI-6 can treat tinnitus and deafness and other ear disorders. Luo points can treat psychological and emotional disorders. LI-6 does not have any emotional symptoms. Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 804; 2005 Edition, page 760; A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 40, 96, 108; Channels of Acupuncture, Maciocia, 2006, page 250, 258",
      "exp_hant": "此症狀乃因該經絡虛弱所致。大腸絡脈起於偏歷（LI-6），於腕上三寸處與其相表裡之肺經相合，沿手臂上行至肩髃（LI-15），再上達頰、頷，其中一支連於齒，另一支入耳。胃、小腸、膽、三焦諸經脈亦皆會聚於耳。偏歷（LI-6）能袪風清熱，通調水道。偏歷（LI-6）作為絡穴，可治療齲齒、齒冷、耳鳴、耳聾、口眼歪斜、頰腫、目視不明，以及腕、肘、上臂疼痛。絡穴可治療其相表裡經脈或臟腑之病症。偏歷（LI-6）可治療急性水腫，此乃外風擾亂肺主通調水道功能所致。絡穴可治療絡脈所過之處的病症。大腸絡脈上達於耳，偏歷（LI-6）可治耳鳴、耳聾及其他耳疾。絡穴亦可治療情志方面的病症。偏歷（LI-6）並無情志方面的主治症狀。Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 804; 2005 Edition, page 760; A Manual of Acupuncture, Deadman, 2nd Edition, page 40, 96, 108; Channels of Acupuncture, Maciocia, 2006, page 250, 258"
