      "exp_en": "Maintaining a balance between Fire and Water is important for health. Fire is the basis of all physiological processes in the body. Fire helps the Heart function of storing the Mind. Fire helps the Spleen transform-transport food qi. Fire helps the Small Intestine separate pure from impure. Fire helps the Bladder to transform-excrete fluids. Fire helps the Uterus to keep the Blood moving. This Fire is called ming men (Gate of Life) and resides between the Kidneys. On the other hand, Water moistens and cools all physiological processes thereby helping to balance Fire. When Water is in excess it tends to flow down and cause leg edema or excess urination. The Kidneys are also the source of Water. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 11; 2005 Edition, page 11; 1989 Edition, page 9",
      "exp_hant": "維持水與火之間的平衡，對健康至關重要。火是人體一切生理過程的基礎。火有助於心藏神的功能。火有助於脾運化水穀之氣。火有助於小腸的泌別清濁。火有助於膀胱氣化排泄津液。火有助於胞宮維持血行不息。此火稱為命門（生命之門），位於兩腎之間。另一方面，水能滋潤並清涼一切生理過程，藉此助火達到平衡。當水過盛時，往往下流而導致下肢水腫或小便過多。腎亦為水之源。The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 11; 2005 Edition, page 11; 1989 Edition, page 9"
