      "exp_en": "The Liver has been compared to a general. On the physical level, the Liver plans the functions of the body by making sure that qi flows smoothly and in the right direction. On the mental level, the Liver plans the execution of our goals and gives direction in life and as such the Liver is the origin of courage (along with the Gall Bladder) and resoluteness. This planning aspect on the mental level depends on the health of the hun (ethereal soul) of the Liver. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 117; 2005 Edition, page 117; 1989 Edition, page 77",
      "exp_hant": "肝被比喻為「將軍」。在生理層面，肝主謀慮，確保氣機順暢、運行方向正確，以規劃身體各項功能。在精神層面，肝負責規劃目標的執行並賦予人生方向，因此肝（與膽共同）為勇氣與果斷的根源。此種精神層面的謀劃能力，有賴於肝魂的健全。The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 117; 2005 Edition, page 117; 1989 Edition, page 77"
    },
