      "exp_en": "The Uterus, one of the Six Extraordinary Yang organs, controls menstruation, conception, and pregnancy. The Uterus has relationships with the Kidneys, the Ren Mai, and the Chong Mai. The Ren Mai and Chong Mai which originate from the Kidneys both flow through the Uterus. When the Kidneys are strong, the Uterus is supplied with abundant Blood and Essence resulting in normal menstruation and fertility. When the Kidneys are weak, then the Ren and Chong Mai will be Empty, resulting in amenorrhea, irregular menstruation, and infertility. The Ren Mai provides qi and essence and the chong mai provides Blood to the Uterus. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 236; 2005 Edition, page 226; 1989 Edition, page 123",
      "exp_hant": "胞宮為奇恆之腑之一，主司月經、受孕與妊娠。胞宮與腎、任脈、衝脈皆有密切關係。發源於腎的任脈與衝脈皆行經胞宮。腎氣充盛時，胞宮得以獲得充足的血與精，月經正常、生育力佳。腎氣虛弱時，任脈與衝脈皆虛，可導致閉經、月經不調及不孕。任脈提供氣與精，衝脈則提供血予胞宮。The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 236; 2005 Edition, page 226; 1989 Edition, page 123"
