          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "a lack of goals",
          "hant": "缺乏目標",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "Somnolence",
          "hant": "嗜睡",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "The Shen (Mind) controls and integrates the Hun (Ethereal Soul). If there is too much coming and going by the Hun or if the Shen fails to control the Hun, there can be mania as too much content from the Hun breaks through to the Mind which fails in its control and integration function. The Mind then becomes scattered, unsettled, confused, and manic. Mania can occur in many degrees of severity that include mental restlessness, agitation, hyperactivity, spending too much money, obsessions, laughing/talking a lot, overactive at night, etc.. In manic behavior, person becomes full of ideas, plans, dreams, and projects that fail in manifesting because the Mind (Shen) is chaotic from the excess coming and going of the Hun. On the other hand, if the Mind (Shen) overcontrols the normal coming and going of Ethereal Soul (Hun) there can be depression as the Hun is no longer free in its movement (coming and going). Conversely, if the control that the Shen (Mind) provides is normal but coming and going of the Hun is not enough, there can also be depression. The Practice of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2008, page 257",
      "exp_hant": "心神主司對魂的統御與整合。若魂往來過度，或心神無法有效統御魂，便可能出現躁狂，因魂中過多的內容衝破心神的控制與整合功能，使心神變得散亂、不安、混亂而躁動。躁狂的嚴重程度可有多種表現，包括心神不寧、煩躁、活動過度、揮霍金錢、強迫思考、多言多笑、夜間過度活躍等。躁狂行為患者滿腦子充滿各種念頭、計畫、幻想與方案，卻因心神因魂往來過度而紊亂，導致這些計畫難以實現。另一方面，若心神對魂正常往來的統御過度，則魂的活動（往來）不再自由，可能導致抑鬱。反之，若心神的統御功能正常，但魂的往來不足，同樣也可能導致抑鬱。The Practice of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2008, page 257"
    },
