      "exp_en": "This is the most complete and accurate answer. It is the chong mai (Penetrating Vessel) which has a strong influence on the breast as the chong mai penetrates the breast. The yin wei mai nourishes Yin and Blood, particularly if there are emotional-mental symptoms (anxiety, obsession, mental restlessness, no motivation or will-power, poor self-control). The yin wei mai can tonify the Heart and can be used for chest pain, stuffy/tight chest, depression, nightmares. The yin wei mai is effective in treating depression and sadness in women who have Blood Deficiency. It treats headaches due to Blood xu. You would needle right PC-6, left SP-4 and add REN-15 and KI-9 (bilateral). The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 932-933",
      "exp_hant": "此為最完整且準確的答案。對乳房有深刻影響的是衝脈，因衝脈貫穿乳房。陰維脈滋養陰血，尤其適用於伴有精神情志症狀（焦慮、強迫思考、心神不寧、缺乏動力或意志力、自制力不佳）的情況。陰維脈可補心，並可用於治療胸痛、胸悶胸緊、抑鬱、噩夢。陰維脈對於血虛婦女的抑鬱與悲傷情緒亦有良好療效，並可治療血虛所致的頭痛。臨床上可右取 PC-6（內關）、左取 SP-4（公孫），並加取 REN-15（鳩尾）與雙側 KI-9（築賓）。The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 932-933"
