    {
      "number": 705,
      "question_en": "In examining skin sores and evaluating the pulse, which indicate that the evil qi is effulgent and the righteous qi is also effulgent?",
      "question_hant": "在檢查瘡瘍並評估脈象時，何種情況顯示邪氣熾盛而正氣也旺盛？",
