          "en": "Is your energy level worse in the morning?",
          "hant": "您的精力在早上是否較差？",
          "correct": true
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Asking about the patient's energy level is not one of the 10 traditional diagnostic questions. The clinical picture can point to a Qi Deficiency particularly Spleen Qi Deficiency which is associated with poor appetite, tiredness, weak muscles, loose stools, a sallow complexion and a pale tongue with teeth marks. In Spleen Qi Deficiency, tiredness is worse in the morning and is coupled with muscle weakness and lassitude. Worsening low energy at night usually can point to Deficiency of Yin with accompanying symptoms of night sweats, malar flush, etc. Tiredness improving with mild exercise, like walking, relieves the Qi stagnation of the Liver. That is because the Wood Element influences the tendons. Exercise moves the tendons which moves the Wood. Fatigue, tiredness and low energy are commonly reported by patients either as an acute / chronic main complaint or as one of the symptoms in a TCM pattern. Chronic fatigue, tiredness and low energy are due mostly to deficiency of Qi, Blood, Yin or Yang but can also be due to chronic excess Dampness and Phlegm. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 348; The Practice of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, Second Edition page 588, 604",
      "exp_hant": "詢問病患的精力狀況並非十項傳統問診（十問）之一。此臨床表現可能指向氣虛，尤其是脾氣虛，常伴隨食慾不振、疲倦、肌肉無力、大便溏薄、面色萎黃及舌淡有齒痕。脾氣虛的疲倦在早晨較為明顯，並伴隨肌肉無力與倦怠感。夜間精力變差則多指向陰虛，並伴隨盜汗、顴紅等症狀。輕度運動（如散步）後疲倦感改善，則有助於疏解肝氣鬱結，因為木行主筋，運動能活動筋，進而疏動肝木之氣。疲倦、倦怠與精力不濟是病患常見的主訴，可能是急性／慢性的主要症狀，也可能是某一證型中的一項症狀。慢性疲倦、倦怠與精力不濟多因氣、血、陰或陽的虛損，但也可能因長期濕邪或痰濕過盛所致。The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 348; The Practice of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, Second Edition page 588, 604"
    },
