      "exp_en": "In a healthy tongue, when ming men (Gate of Fire) joins with the Heart, the tip of the tongue can have pale red papillae (small projections on tongue body that discern taste). When the ming men joins with the Lung, the tongue center will have soft white papillae. A tongue tip with pale red papillae and tongue center with soft white papillae means that the Kidneys (ming men), Lungs, and Heart are healthy. When the tip of the tongue becomes prominently red, it can indicate Heart Fire.If the very tip of the tongue is red, then it indicates Heart Fire but if a larger area of the tip is red then it can indicate Lung Heat. The darker the tip the more intense the Fire. If the whole tongue is red and the tip is even redder still, then it can also indicate heat in the blood and ying levels. If the tongue body is normal and only the tip is red, then it is due to a less intense Heart Fire caused by less intense emotional problems. Only the tip being red can be caused by lack of sleep. Tongue Diagnosis in Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 1995, page 26, 46",
      "exp_hant": "在健康的舌象中，當命門（火之門）與心相合時，舌尖可見淡紅色的舌乳頭（舌體上辨別味覺的小突起）。當命門與肺相合時，舌中會出現柔軟的白色舌乳頭。舌尖有淡紅舌乳頭、舌中有柔軟白色舌乳頭，代表腎（命門）、肺、心功能健康。當舌尖轉為明顯的紅色時，可能顯示心火。若僅舌尖尖端發紅，顯示心火；若舌尖較大範圍發紅，則可能顯示肺熱。舌尖顏色愈深，代表火愈盛。若整個舌都紅、舌尖更紅，則可能顯示熱入血分及營分。若舌體正常、僅舌尖發紅，則是較輕微的心火，多因情緒問題較輕所致。僅舌尖發紅也可能是睡眠不足所致。Tongue Diagnosis in Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 1995, page 26, 46"
