      "exp_en": "Diagnosis by smell is usually used to confirm the diagnosis arrived at by other means. Smell is seldom the \"ah, ah this is the diagnosis\" factor. In terms of Five-Element theory, smell is used to determine whether there is a correspondence or a deviation from the constitutional element. A Metal type that has a rotten smell is a less serious sign than a Metal type with fragrant-sweet smell. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 399; 2005 Edition, page 379; 1989 Edition, page 153",
      "exp_hant": "嗅診通常用於佐證以其他方法所得出的診斷，很少單獨作為「啊，就是這個診斷」的決定性依據。就五行理論而言，嗅診用於判斷是否與體質所屬的五行相應，或有所偏離。金型人若有腐臭味，其嚴重程度較金型人有芳香甘甜味者為輕。The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 399; 2005 Edition, page 379; 1989 Edition, page 153"
    },
