          "hant": "25-35／3-7",
          "correct": true
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "If the time between cycles is too short it is often due to Blood heat. If too long, it is often due to Blood vacuity. If the time between periods is undetermined, sometimes early and sometimes late, this is often due to Kidney vacuity or Liver depression. If the period of the menstrual flow is too short or too long or the menstrual blood is too little or too much, this is often due to qi and blood not being regulated. Deep red menstrual blood often indicates heat while paleness indicates vacuity. If the blood is thick, this indicates heat. If the blood has clots, this indicates stasis. If there is abdominal distention prior to the period, then this is often due to Qi or Blood stasis. Dull pain in the lower abdomen after menstruation, is generally due to Blood Vacuity. In a healthy young woman when the menstruation stops, it is important to consider pregnancy. In elderly women who have stopped menstruating and then suddenly menstruation begins, the doctor needs to pay attention to blood pattern changes involving flooding and spotting. Practical Diagnosis in Traditional Chinese Medicine, Deng, 1999, page 356",
      "exp_hant": "若週期過短，多因血熱所致；若週期過長，多因血虛所致。若週期不定，時早時遲，多因腎虛或肝鬱所致。若經期過短或過長，或經量過少或過多，多因氣血失調所致。經血色深紅多顯示熱，色淡則顯示虛。經血質稠顯示熱，若有血塊則顯示血瘀。若經前腹脹，多因氣滯或血瘀所致。經後小腹隱痛，一般因血虛所致。健康年輕女性若月經停止，須考慮懷孕的可能。年長女性已停經後又突然來經，醫師須留意涉及崩漏的血證變化。Practical Diagnosis in Traditional Chinese Medicine, Deng, 1999, page 356"
