      "exp_en": "The common causes of skin pain and swelling include Fire, Cold, Damp, Wind, Phlegm, Qi Stasis, and Blood Stasis. Phlegm type of swellings have lumps that can be hard or soft with a sac-like sensation that are painless. Painful watery swellings that feel heavy and distended and depress with the application of pressure is generally due to Dampness. Superficial swellings that rapidly change are generally due to Wind. Painful swellings that are red and hot and improve with a cold compress are generally due to Heat. Painful swellings with stabbing-fixed pain with a green-blue-purple color are generally due to Blood Stasis. Painful swellings that come and go with stressful emotions are generally due to Qi Stasis. Practical Diagnosis in Traditional Chinese Medicine, Deng, 1999, page 379",
      "exp_hant": "皮膚疼痛與腫脹常見病因包括火、寒、濕、風、痰、氣滯及血瘀。痰型腫塊質地可硬可軟，有囊袋樣的觸感，且無痛感。疼痛且水腫樣、感覺沉重脹滿、按壓可凹陷的腫塊，一般因濕邪所致。表淺且變化迅速的腫塊，一般因風邪所致。疼痛、紅腫發熱且冷敷可改善的腫塊，一般因熱邪所致。疼痛呈刺痛、固定不移，色呈青紫的腫塊，一般因血瘀所致。隨情緒起伏時發時止的疼痛腫塊，一般因氣滯所致。Practical Diagnosis in Traditional Chinese Medicine, Deng, 1999, page 379"
