      "exp_en": "This pattern is Internal, Hot, and Full. The symptoms of excess Fire include thirst, red face, hot feelings, red tongue, and rapid-overflowing pulse. As the tongue is the offshoot of the Heart and when the excess-full Heat flares upward there will be tongue ulcers which are red, have a raised rim, and are very painful (ulcers with a white rim can be caused by the Empty-Heat arising from yin deficiency). The mental restlessness Heart Fire Blazing is more severe, with more agitation. The insomnia in this pattern there is frequent awakenings with disturbing dreams (fires, flying). In Heart Fire Blazing the whole face is red while with Deficiency Yin with Empty Heat only the cheeks are red. The bitter mouth taste is due to Full Heat in the Heart because the Heart controls taste and opens into the tongue. The bitter mouth taste from Heart Fire occurs only after a night of poor sleep while the bitter mouth taste due to Liver Fire happens every day. The urine can be just dark (due to heat) or there can be some bleeding (due to Heart Fire transmitted to Small Intestine and then to Bladder). The treatment principle is to Clear Heat, Drain Fire, and Calm Shen. The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 500; 2005 Edition, page 472; 1989 Edition, page 208",
      "exp_hant": "此證型屬裡、熱、實證。實火的症狀包括口渴、面赤、發熱感、舌紅及脈數而洪。因舌為心之苗，當過盛的實熱上炎，會出現舌上潰瘍，潰瘍紅、邊緣隆起、疼痛劇烈（邊緣呈白色的潰瘍則可能是陰虛所致的虛熱引起）。心火熾盛的心神不安較為嚴重，躁動感也較明顯。此證型的失眠表現為多夢紛擾、易醒多夢（如夢見火災、飛翔）。心火熾盛時整臉發紅，而陰虛兼虛熱則僅兩頰發紅。口苦是因心中實熱所致，因心主味覺並開竅於舌。心火所致的口苦僅在夜間睡眠不佳後出現，而肝火所致的口苦則每日皆有。小便可僅色深（因熱所致），或伴有出血（因心火傳至小腸，再傳至膀胱所致）。治則為清熱、瀉火、寧心安神。The Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 500; 2005 Edition, page 472; 1989 Edition, page 208"
