      "exp_en": "NOURISHES BRAIN AND MARROW: Kidney Essence produces Marrow which fills the spine and Brain. The du mai balances yin and yang in the head and brain by transporting Kidney Essence to the brain. The du mai connects with the brain upward and the Kidneys downward. Deficiency of Marrow can manifest as dizziness, tinnitus, weak legs, blurred vision, poor concentration and memory. The du mai has a branch which enters the brain. STRENGHTENS THE MIND: The Mind has a close connection to the Essence of the Kidneys. That is, the Mind originates from the Prenatal Essence stored in the Kidneys. After birth the Mind is nourished by the Postnatal Essence the Blood generated from food and air. Though the Mind is stored in the Heart, it has its foundations in the Kidney Essence which produces Bone Marrow that fills the brain. The du mai has an internal branch that goes through the Heart. To strengthen the Mind both the Heart and Kidneys can be tonified. TONIFIES KIDNEY YANG: The du mai governs all yang in the body, especially Kidney yang. The main point that tonifies Kidney yang is DU-4. As a branch of the du mai goes to the vagina, it can be used to treat GYN symptoms on background of Kidney yang deficiency. STRENGHTENS THE BACK: The du mai treats all cases of Kidney deficiency back pain through the use of the opening and coupled points as well as points on the du mai. EXTINGUISHES INTERIOR WIND: many du mai points can treat the interior wind symptoms of convulsions, tremors, epilepsy, post wind-stroke symptoms. EXPELS EXTERNAL WIND: the du mai can be selected to release exterior wind at the tai-yang stage to treat aversion to cold, fever, stiff neck, and floating pulse. The du mai can treat intermittent fevers with residual heat, where the pathogenic factor is not fully expelled but lies internally dormant such as can occur with post-viral fatigue syndrome. Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 892-896; 2005 Edition, page 844",
      "exp_hant": "滋養腦髓：腎精化生髓，髓充於脊柱與腦。督脈藉由將腎精輸送至腦，調節頭部與腦的陰陽平衡。督脈上連於腦，下連於腎。髓海不足可表現為頭暈、耳鳴、腿軟無力、視物模糊、注意力與記憶力不佳。督脈有一分支入腦。強志：志與腎精有密切關係，也就是說，志源於藏於腎中的先天之精。出生後，志由後天之精，即由飲食、呼吸所化生的血所滋養。雖然志藏於心，但其根本在於腎精所化生的骨髓，充養於腦。督脈有一內行分支通過心。要強志，可同時補益心與腎。補腎陽：督脈總督一身之陽，尤其是腎陽。補腎陽的主穴為DU-4。因督脈有一分支通往陰道，可用於治療腎陽虛為背景的婦科症狀。強腰：督脈藉由運用八脈交會穴中的開穴與應穴，以及督脈上的穴位，治療一切因腎虛所致的腰痛。熄內風：許多督脈穴位可治療內風症狀，如抽搐、震顫、癲癇、中風後遺症。祛外風：督脈可用於太陽階段解表祛風，治療惡寒、發熱、頸項強直及浮脈。督脈亦可治療餘邪未清、伏而不去的間歇性發熱，如病毒感染後的慢性疲勞症候群即可能出現此情形。Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 892-896; 2005 Edition, page 844"
