      "exp_en": "This is the most complete and accurate answer. Pericardium Heat is at the ying or nutritive qi level. At the ying level the Heat has traveled to a deeper level in the body, injuring the yin. The Heat at this level obstructs the Mind and Pericardium which can cause delirium and coma. The characteristic sign of Heat at the ying level is night fever. The tongue is also an important differentiating sign between the Qi level (red with thick coating) and Ying level (deep red without coating). The Blood level is the deepest layer where Heat enters the Blood. There are five patterns at this level: Heat Victorious Moving Blood, Heat Victorious Stirring Wind, Empty-Wind Agitating the Interior, Collapse of Yin, and Collapse of Yang. The main characteristics at the Blood Level is that there is Yin deficiency, Blood Heat causes bleeding, Heat causing delirium, macules, and the development of Internal Wind that causes convulsions and tremors. At its extreme, there is a Yin Collapse (abundant sweating, hot skin, hot limbs, dry mouth with desire to drink cold in small sips, urinary retention, constipation, floating-empty-rapid pulse, red peeled, short-dry tongue) or Yang can collapse (cold limbs, weak breathing, profuse oily sweat, no thirst, frequent-profuse urination, loose stools, incontinence, a minute-deep pulse and pale-wet-swollen-short tongue). Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 465, 767, 768",
      "exp_hant": "這是最完整且正確的答案。熱入心包屬於營分（營氣層次）。在營分階段，熱邪已傳入體內較深層次，損傷陰液。此層次的熱邪會阻蔽心神與心包，可導致神昏譫語。夜間發熱是營分熱邪的特徵性徵象。舌象也是區分氣分（紅舌厚苔）與營分（深紅無苔）的重要鑑別要點。血分是最深的層次，此時熱邪已入血分。此層次共有五種證型：熱盛迫血、熱盛動風、虛風內動、陰脫、陽脫。血分層次的主要特徵為陰虛、血熱導致出血、熱擾神明、發斑，以及內風形成導致抽搐與震顫。病情發展至極端時，可出現陰脫（大汗淋漓、皮膚灼熱、四肢灼熱、口乾欲飲但只想小口喝冷水、小便不通、便秘、脈浮虛數、舌紅剝苔且舌體短而乾），或陽脫（四肢厥冷、呼吸微弱、大汗淋漓如油、不渴、小便頻多量多、大便溏薄、失禁、脈微沉、舌淡濕潤胖大而短）。Foundations of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2015, page 465, 767, 768"
