      "number": 784,
      "question_en": "A 45 year-old male patient has had persistent dry mouth and eyes for the past three years. For the past month these symptoms were associated with yellowish skin and sclera. He reported mental fatigue, lack of strength, weight loss with emaciation, poor appetite, an aversion to oily and greasy foods, yellow urine, and loose unformed stools. The tongue was pale with some dark-purple coloration with teethmarks on the sides. The tongue coating was thick greasy-white-yellow. The pulse was deep and thready. Lab tests showed ANA 1:320, Sjogren's syndrome antibodies SS-A (+++), SS-B (+). Liver function tests showed elevated ALT and bilirubin. He was diagnosed with Sjogren's syndrome. What is the cause of the dryness?",
      "question_hant": "一名45歲男性患者持續口乾、眼乾已三年。近一個月來這些症狀伴隨皮膚及鞏膜發黃。他自訴精神疲憊、乏力、體重減輕且形體消瘦、食慾不振、厭惡油膩食物、小便黃、大便溏瀉不成形。舌淡而略帶暗紫色，舌邊有齒痕，苔厚膩、白黃相兼。脈沉細。實驗室檢查顯示ANA 1:320，乾燥症抗體SS-A（+++）、SS-B（+）。肝功能檢查顯示ALT及膽紅素升高。他被診斷為修格倫氏症候群（乾燥症）。造成其乾燥症狀的原因為何？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "dryness due to phlegm-dampness and blood stasis blocking the Liver collaterals",
          "hant": "痰濕與血瘀阻滯肝絡所致之燥",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "dryness due to dampness-phlegm obstruction of the Liver collaterals",
          "hant": "濕痰阻滯肝絡所致之燥",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "dryness due to blood stasis obstruction the Liver collaterals",
          "hant": "血瘀阻滯肝絡所致之燥",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
