      ],
      "exp_en": "Sjogren's syndrome does not exist as a disease category in TCM but is associated with a dryness pattern. The yellow skin, sclera, and urination are signs of jaundice and indicate Liver involvement. The pale tongue with teethmarks, the thick tongue coating, the deep-thready pulse, poor appetite, mental fatigue, an unformed loose stools all indicate yin jaundice due to deficient yang with dampness accumulation. The phlegm-accumulation blocks the flow of blood and produces blood stasis (dark-purple tongue). The phlegm-dampness blocks the bile duct which allows bile to flow in the blood leading to yellow skin and sclera. The dryness is due to phlegm-dampness and blood stasis blocking the Liver collaterals. Treatment should focus on both resolving the pathogens of blood stasis and phlegm-dampness and also warming the yang and boosting the qi. TCM Case Studies: Autoimmune Disease, Sheng-ping, Fratkin, and Jing, 2014, page 78-80",
      "exp_hant": "修格倫氏症候群（乾燥症）在中醫並無對應之病名，惟屬燥證範疇。皮膚、鞏膜及小便發黃為黃疸之徵象，顯示肝之受累。舌淡有齒痕、苔厚膩、脈沉細、食慾不振、精神疲憊及大便溏瀉不成形，皆顯示因陽虛濕聚所致之陰黃。痰濕蘊積阻礙血行而生血瘀（舌質暗紫）。痰濕阻滯膽道，致膽汁滲入血中，形成皮膚及鞏膜發黃。此乾燥症狀乃因痰濕與血瘀阻滯肝絡所致。治療應著重袪除血瘀與痰濕之邪，並溫陽益氣。TCM Case Studies: Autoimmune Disease, Sheng-ping, Fratkin, and Jing, 2014, page 78-80"
    },
    {
      "number": 785,
      "question_en": "A 47 year-old man has had pain over the right abdomen for the past four months. He had surgery to remove gallstones but the pain returned. The pain radiates to the left scapula. Other symptoms include a dry mouth with bitter taste, bloating, poor appetite, nausea, scanty urination, and a burning anus during defecation. His pain worsens with greasy and fatty foods. He has a swollen scrotum. Emotionally he is irritable and the pain worsens at such times. The tongue is red with a yellow and white coating. The pulse is wiry, slippery and a little rapid. What is the diagnosis?",
      "question_hant": "一名47歲男性右腹疼痛已持續四個月。他曾接受手術移除膽結石，但疼痛復發，並放射至左肩胛。其他症狀包括口乾口苦、腹脹、食慾不振、噁心、小便短少、排便時肛門灼熱感。進食油膩肥厚食物後疼痛加重。他有陰囊腫脹。情緒上性情急躁易怒，發怒時疼痛加重。舌紅，苔黃白相兼，脈弦滑略數。診斷為何？",
