      "exp_en": "The Liver spreads and regulates the flow of qi and Blood. The Gall Bladder stores the \"accumulated Essence\", the bile. Emotional issues, bad eating habits, and inner Damp-Heat interferes with the normal functioning of the Liver and Gall Bladder. The bitter taste, dry mouth, difficult BM, and scanty urination, and aversion to greasy food point to internal Damp-Heat. Protracted Damp-Heat causes the bile to congeal into stones. As the Liver channel encircles the genital area, the presence of Damp-Heat can lead to a swollen scrotum. The bloating, poor appetite, and nausea indicate the Liver attacking the Spleen-Stomach. When the Liver is affected by pathogenic factors, irritability and anger can manifest. The red tongue with yellowish-white coating, slippery-rapid pulse point to Damp-Heat. Acupuncture Case Histories, Chen and Wang, 1988, page 65",
      "exp_hant": "肝主疏泄，調暢氣血運行；膽貯藏「精汁」，即膽汁。情志失調、飲食不節及內蘊濕熱皆可影響肝膽正常功能。口苦口乾、排便困難、小便短少及厭惡油膩食物皆指向內有濕熱。濕熱久蘊使膽汁凝結成石。因肝經環繞前陰部位，濕熱存在可致陰囊腫脹。腹脹、食慾不振及噁心顯示肝木犯及脾胃。肝受邪氣所擾時，可表現為急躁易怒。舌紅苔黃白相兼、脈滑數皆指向濕熱。Acupuncture Case Histories, Chen and Wang, 1988, page 65"
    },
    {
      "number": 786,
      "question_en": "A 45 year-old female patient has had severe headaches since she was 16 years old. She regularly had mid menstrual cycle throbbing headaches. The head pain was over the eyes. During her headaches, she had dizziness, blurred vision, and nausea. Her doctor prescribed hormone replacement therapy. But after 18 months, her headaches did not improve but got worse. Other symptoms she had were back pain, tinnitus, and night sweats. She had regular periods every 26 days and lasting 4-5 days. Her period was not painful. The blood was not black. She had frequent and pale urination. She had cold feet. Her tongue was pale and swollen. The pulse was very weak in the rear positions. What is the cause of her headache?",
      "question_hant": "一名45歲女性患者自16歲起即有嚴重頭痛，經期中段常規律性出現搏動性頭痛，痛在眼眶上方。頭痛發作時伴頭暈、視物模糊及噁心。醫師曾為她開立荷爾蒙替代療法，惟18個月後頭痛不僅未改善反而加重。其他症狀包括腰痛、耳鳴及盜汗。月經週期規律，約26天一次，經期4-5天，經行不痛，經血不呈黑色。她有頻尿且尿色淡，並有足冷。舌淡而胖大，兩尺脈甚弱。其頭痛之病因為何？",
